Cell["\<\
15. Public output is hygienic under a shadowing Block: EinstoffShapes' \
Bindings keys
are axis identities (SymbolName recovers the user name), never the shadowed \
VALUE.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->67656956],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Block", "[",
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{",
    RowBox[{"c", "=", "3"}], "}"}], ",",
   RowBox[{"Sort", "[",
    RowBox[{"bindingKeyName", "/@",
     RowBox[{"Keys", "[",
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Einstoff`EinstoffShapes", "[",
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{",
           RowBox[{"{",
            RowBox[{"a_", ",", "c_"}], "}"}], "}"}], "\[RuleDelayed]",
          RowBox[{"{",
           RowBox[{"{",
            RowBox[{"c", ",", "a"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], ",",
         RowBox[{"{",
          RowBox[{"{",
           RowBox[{"2", ",", "3"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], "]"}],
       "[", "\"\<Bindings\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
  "]"}]], "VerificationTest",
