Cell["\<\
A repeated/shared inferred LHS axis must repeat the blank spelling (`a_ ... \
a_`).
The old blank-then-bare spelling (`a_ ... a`) is native-WL literal syntax, \
not a
pattern reference, and is rejected before lowering.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->918595424],

