Cell["\<\
===================== repetition is a Massage feature ============\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->29955970],

Cell["\<\
Repetition (SPEC 5.5, an output-only axis of size > 1) is NOT bijective, so \
it moved
out of Einstoff[ArrayReshape] and lives on the permissive \
Einstoff[\"Massage\"] engine.
These tests exercise the repeat lowering itself (numerics unchanged); the \
companion
section below asserts the bijective guard now REJECTS the same descs.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->947641443],

